  "_checks_comment": "Granular, node-scoped check definitions run by the tree runner (scripts/hermes_tree.py). Each maps a check name used in a node's 'checks' to how to run it. type 'test' → php artisan test <target>. The broad checks (phpstan/tests/doc-coverage/pint/…) run repo-wide via hermes.sh and are NOT defined here.",
